{
  "description": "Enhanced receipt-decoding coverage: an empty receipt list (zero indexed), two distinct receipts listed in ascending hash order, a duplicate receipt collapsing to one entry, and malformed JSON yielding the neutral decode error. Disjoint from the native single-receipt case.",
